#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog, abstracted circuit function and application function services designed to accelerate research and application prototyping."
msgstr "Terokai Katalog Qiskit Functions IBM, perkhidmatan fungsi litar dan fungsi aplikasi yang diabstrak, direka untuk mempercepatkan penyelidikan dan prototaip aplikasi."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada Qiskit Functions"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
